    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Rebound Express Inc.!</strong><br>As Warehouse Distribution Manager, it\u2019s your job to ensure that every wrapped and packaged parcel makes it to its designated shipping facility \u2014 by any (bouncy) means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Rebound Express  is a 2D physics puzzle game where parcels are launched from fixed emitters and must reach specific receivers scattered across the board. To guide them, you\u2019ll place and rotate a variety of modular platforms across a grid-based warehouse environment. Some platforms are simple walls, others are perfectly elastic bouncers, and some are high-powered boosters that add extra speed to the mix.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your layout is in place, you can fine-tune the launch speed of the parcels to optimize their trajectory. When you're satisfied with your setup, hit <strong>submit</strong> \u2014 then watch as your plan comes to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your performance is evaluated based on how quickly you complete the delivery, how many parcels you lose along the way, and the precision of your setup. Bonus stars are scattered across some levels for those who like to push for perfection \u2014 collect them for extra points and bragging rights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Efficiency is everything, and the clock is ticking. After all, your warehouse <i>is</i> the bottleneck of the entire global logistics chain \u2014 so no pressure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rebound Express was created as an entry for a one-week game jam among friends.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Rebound Express Inc.!</strong><br>As Warehouse Distribution Manager, it\u2019s your job to ensure that every wrapped and packaged parcel makes it to its designated shipping facility \u2014 by any (bouncy) means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Rebound Express  is a 2D physics puzzle game where parcels are launched from fixed emitters and must reach specific receivers scattered across the board. To guide them, you\u2019ll place and rotate a variety of modular platforms across a grid-based warehouse environment. Some platforms are simple walls, others are perfectly elastic bouncers, and some are high-powered boosters that add extra speed to the mix.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your layout is in place, you can fine-tune the launch speed of the parcels to optimize their trajectory. When you're satisfied with your setup, hit <strong>submit</strong> \u2014 then watch as your plan comes to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your performance is evaluated based on how quickly you complete the delivery, how many parcels you lose along the way, and the precision of your setup. Bonus stars are scattered across some levels for those who like to push for perfection \u2014 collect them for extra points and bragging rights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Efficiency is everything, and the clock is ticking. After all, your warehouse <i>is</i> the bottleneck of the entire global logistics chain \u2014 so no pressure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rebound Express was created as an entry for a one-week game jam among friends.</i></p>",
